<title>JAPAN: LTCB shares slip after recent rally.</title>
<headline>LTCB shares slip after recent rally.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long-Term Credit Bank of Japan Ltd (LTCB) shares slipped on Friday morning after climbing recently on the news that the bank and Swiss Bank Corp would form a global strategic alliance, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0027 GMT, LTCB shares were down 27 yen or 4.70 percent at 548 yen, the third-sharpest percentage loser on the first section on the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
